<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Retail sales, CPI, prod prices.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Retail sales, CPI, prod prices.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Retail sales	Jan     -4.4 pct y/y, -3.2 m/m    Mar 18-19</p>
<p> Final CPI	   Feb	  prelim 1.8 pct	   Mar 20</p>
<p> Producer prices   Feb     +0.3 pct m/m, +0.7 y/y    Mar 21</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
